              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Has a hand weapon, light armour and buckler. Army General. May have shield (+1), heavy armour (+1), throwing or thrusting spear (+2), javelins (+2) or composite bow (+4) and half-barding (+2)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
