              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Bulgar elite and other horse archers have a hand weapon, buckler and composite bow. Nomad Cavalry. May have throwing or thrusting spear (+3). All Slav cavalry have a hand weapon, javelins and buckler. Skirmishers. Feigned Flight. May have shield (+1) and throwing spear (+3).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
